  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"\" open=\"{\" separators=\"|\"><mtable><mtr><mtd><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>;</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&#8804;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&#60;</mo><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>;</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&#8804;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&#60;</mo><mn>2</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>;</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#8804;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8804;</mo><mn>3</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"\" open=\"{\" separators=\"|\"><mtable><mtr><mtd><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>;</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&#8804;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&#60;</mo><mn>0</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>&#8804;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&#60;</mo><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>;</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&#8804;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&#60;</mo><mn>2</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#8804;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&#60;</mo><mn>3</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>6</mn><mo>;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>&#160;</mi></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced></math></p><p>At <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><mn>3</mn></math> <math><mi>f</mi></math> changes its definition.</p><p><math><mo>&#8756;</mo></math>&nbsp;At <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>LHL</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>RHL</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">f</mi></math> &nbsp;is discontinuous at</p><p><math><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>LHL</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>RHL</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>f</mi></math>&nbsp;is discontinuous at <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>LHL</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>RHL</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mn>2</mn></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>f</mi></math>&nbsp;is continuous at <math><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>LHL</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mn>3</mn></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>f</mi></math> is discontinuous at <math><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p><math><mo>&#8756;</mo></math> Points of discontinuity are <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><mn>3</mn><mo>.</mo></math></p>"
